project chat's message box\n9cf641098c Stop naming Orca to the model, and keep each request sent to it\n034eb878b3 Judge the print prompt tests by what the person ends up with"}},"type":"attachment","uuid":"02f6b891-7566-4663-9072-e2e5a748ec19","timestamp":"2026-11-03T04:50:15.040Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nAs you answer the user's questions, you can use the following context:\n# userEmail\nThe user's email address is k@obico.io. Use it only to identify the user, such as for authorship, attribution, or filtering their own work. Never send it to an unrelated service, such as in a request header, URL, or payload, unless the user explicitly asks.\n# gitStatus\nThis is the git status at the start of the conversation. Note that this status is a snapshot in time, and will not update during the conversation.\n\nCurrent branch: jusprin-newui\n\nMain branch (you will usually use this for PRs): main\n\nGit user: Kenneth Jiang\n\nStatus:\n?? .playwright-mcp/\n?? chat-history-cache-handoff.md\n?? chat-history-cache-plan.md\n?? chat-history-measurement.md\n?? claude-cli-baseline-candidate-2026-10-30.json\n?? claude-cli-full-rewritten-2026-10-30.json\n?? claude-cli-hook-plan-2026-10-30.json\n?? claude-cli-print-this-hook-2026-10-30.json\n?? claude-cli-run-2026-10-30.json\n?? credits-and-onboarding-handoff-2026-11.md\n?? design-captures/\n?? first-launch-animatic-2026-11.md\n?? first-run-flow-design-2026-11.md\n?? journey-cost-2026-10-runs/\n?? journey-cost-2026-10.md\n?? live-prompt-run-2026-10-29.json\n?? live-prompt-run-2026-10-29.md\n?? obico-pro-pricing-data-2026-10.md\n?? opening-message-replies-2026-10-30.md\n?? p1s-live-chat-2026-11-01.md\n?? pricing-case-studies-2026-10.md\n?? pricing-implementation-plan-2026-11.md\n?? pricing-mental-model-2026-10.md\n?? pricing-touchpoints-design-2026-11.md\n?? printer-connect-live-check.md\n?? tool-result-repro-2026-11-02.md\n?? tool-silent-failures-notes.md\n?? tool-silent-failures-sweep-2026-11-01.md\n?? tool-silent-