{"parentUuid":"b91e1de3-60ad-4902-b1e1-67021fcf9b3f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3dbd4941-397f-4f1f-b100-534960d73c43","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Krhi2Yo9XrpDJPvP25zpxV","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nname: first-run-flow-sequence\ndescription: \"Kenneth's 2026-11-02 first-run flow after the welcome: a sequence Welcome → Printers → Home owned by a controller, with the agent doors as detours that return (sign-in waits on the card, Preferences closes back, Just slice skips the detour not the sequence); Printers step imports OrcaSlicer or adds/assumes a printer; what the canvas still lacks.\"\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nDecided 2026-11-02, late, after Kenneth asked how Preferences gets back to the OrcaSlicer import and how \"Just slice for now\" returns to onboarding (\"I don't think you have thought through\").\n\n- **Shape:** onboarding is a sequence, Welcome → Printers → Home. A controller owns the step. Preferences (a modal `PreferencesWindow`, returns on close) and the browser sign-in (loopback callback on port 41172, polled by `CloudSignIn::poll()`) are detours off step 1; when one finishes the controller advances. Nothing a detour does strands the person outside the sequence.\n- **Welcome doors:** Sign in → browser; the card shows \"Finish signing in in your browser\" with Cancel, other doors dimmed; on the callback the card flips to \"Signed in as … · 500 credits\", then step 2. Own key / MCP → Preferences › Agent opens modal on that section; saving a verified key or Done closes it and advances; closing unfinished returns to the welcome with nothing chosen. Just slice → step 2 at once.\n- **Printers step:** the app needs one printer (an empty data folder has none). OrcaSlicer folder found → \"Bring your printers from OrcaSlicer?\" with Import (copies user presets like `V1Import`, but asked, not silent) and Start fresh. JusPrin v1 found → step skipped, the existing welcome-back window shows over Home. Neither → the add-printer form with \"Skip, use a default\", which installs the default and marks the chip assumed. Back returns to the welcome; finished detours stay done. A 3MF opened on first launch still shows the welcome, then skips this step (\"from the file\").\n- **Home:** first-run state reflects the choices: agent connected and the 500 credits shown once, or the three doors collapsed in the agent column after Just slice; the Printers column lists imported/added/assumed.\n- **Quit mid-flow:** done is marked only when Home is reached; next launch shows the welcome again with finished detours reflected.\n\n**Why:** the first design named destinations and skipped transitions; Kenneth wants every door to come back into one flow.\n\n**How to apply:** build the controller first, then the screens; the canvas needs the welcome's waiting and signed-in card states, the OrcaSlicer import screen, the add-printer form with skip, Home after sign-in and after Just slice, a flow board, and the old wizard boards marked superseded. Related: [[first-run-value-prop-decisions]], [[first-run-flow-boards]], [[agent-setup-one-flow-decisions]].\n__pycache__\nadd_turn_line_boards.py\nancestry.py\nbuild_all_settings.py\nbuild_calibration_page.py\nbuild_check_print_page.py\nbuild_composer_board.py\nbuild_composer_card.py\nbuild_credits_page.py\nbuild_filament_step.py\nbuild_file_printer_page.py\nbuild_first_run_page.py\nbuild_key_states.py\nbuild_key_states.py.bak-2026-10-21\nbuild_no_agent_boards.py\nbuild_search_board.py\nbuild_setup_card_rework.py\nbuild_sticky_options.py\nbuild_turn_action_details.py\nbuild_turn_activity_board.py\nchat_text_step_up.py\nchat_text_step_up_specs.py\ncomposer_html.py\ndock_setup.py\nfilament_step_heights.json\nfit_content.py\ngrow_frames.py\nhtmlfrag.py\nmeasure_boards.py\nmeasure_previews.py\nmeasure_sheets.py\noverflow_check.py\nrender.py\nrender_dc.py\nresize_board.py\nsetup_card_icons.json\nsetup_card_lib.py\nspec_lines.py\nturn_yes.json\nupdate_matrix.py\nupdate_recovery.py\nupdate_screens.py\nupdate_specs.py\nwalkthrough.json\ndict_keys(['v', 'attachments', 'boards', 'createdOnFiles', 'designSystems', 'launch', 'noteOrder', 'notes', 'order', 'pages', 'title'])\n[('main-page', 'Main Page'), ('compositions', 'Compositions'), ('setup-card', 'Current Setup Card'), ('plates-project', 'Plates & Project Pane'), ('printer-material', 'Printer & Material Settings'), ('agent-ui', 'Agent UI · States & Components'), ('onboarding', 'On boarding experience'), ('calibration', 'Calibration · Printer & Filament'), ('check-print', 'Check print · Plan verification'), ('agent-prefs', 'Agent setup & Preferences'), ('print-history', 'Print history'), ('credits-plans', 'Credits & plans')]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f9f9f2ff-c1be-4e7b-9279-19cca04a7617","timestamp":"2026-11-03T05:05:23.095Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\nname: first-run-flow-sequence\ndescription: \"Kenneth's 2026-11-02 first-run flow after the welcome: a sequence Welcome → Printers → Home owned by a controller, with the agent doors as detours that return (sign-in waits on the card, Preferences closes back, Just slice skips the detour not the sequence); Printers step imports OrcaSlicer or adds/assumes a printer; what the canvas still lacks.\"\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nDecided 2026-11-02, late, after Kenneth asked how Preferences gets back to the OrcaSlicer import and how \"Just slice for now\" returns to onboarding (\"I don't think you have thought through\").\n\n- **Shape:** onboarding is a sequence, Welcome → Printers → Home. A controller owns the step. Preferences (a modal `PreferencesWindow`, returns on close) and the browser sign-in (loopback callback on port 41172, polled by `CloudSignIn::poll()`) are detours off step 1; when one finishes the controller advances. Nothing a detour does strands the person outside the sequence.\n- **Welcome doors:** Sign in → browser; the card shows \"Finish signing in in your browser\" with Cancel, other doors dimmed; on the callback the card flips to \"Signed in as … · 500 credits\", then step 2. Own key / MCP → Preferences › Agent opens modal on that section; saving a verified key or Done closes it and advances; closing unfinished returns to the welcome with nothing chosen. Just slice → step 2 at once.\n- **Printers step:** the app needs one printer (an empty data folder has none). OrcaSlicer folder found → \"Bring your printers from OrcaSlicer?\" with Import (copies user presets like `V1Import`, but asked, not silent) and Start fresh. JusPrin v1 found → step skipped, the existing welcome-back window shows over Home. Neither → the add-printer form with \"Skip, use a default\", which installs the default and marks the chip assumed. Back returns to the welcome; finished detours stay done. A 3MF opened on first launch still shows the welcome, then skips this step (\"from the file\").\n- **Home:** first-run state reflects the choices: agent connected and the 500 credits shown once, or the three doors collapsed in the agent column after Just slice; the Printers column lists imported/added/assumed.\n- **Quit mid-flow:** done is marked only when Home is reached; next launch shows the welcome again with finished detours reflected.\n\n**Why:** the first design named destinations and skipped transitions; Kenneth wants every door to come back into one flow.\n\n**How to apply:** build the controller first, then the screens; the canvas needs the welcome's waiting and signed-in card states, the OrcaSlicer import screen, the add-printer form with skip, Home after sign-in and after Just slice, a flow board, and the old wizard boards marked superseded. Related: [[first-run-value-prop-decisions]], [[first-run-flow-boards]], [[agent-setup-one-flow-decisions]].\n__pycache__\nadd_turn_line_boards.py\nancestry.py\nbuild_all_settings.py\nbuild_calibration_page.py\nbuild_check_print_page.py\nbuild_composer_board.py\nbuild_composer_card.py\nbuild_credits_page.py\nbuild_filament_step.py\nbuild_file_printer_page.py\nbuild_first_run_page.py\nbuild_key_states.py\nbuild_key_states.py.bak-2026-10-21\nbuild_no_agent_boards.py\nbuild_search_board.py\nbuild_setup_card_rework.py\nbuild_sticky_options.py\nbuild_turn_action_details.py\nbuild_turn_activity_board.py\nchat_text_step_up.py\nchat_text_step_up_specs.py\ncomposer_html.py\ndock_setup.py\nfilament_step_heights.json\nfit_content.py\ngrow_frames.py\nhtmlfrag.py\nmeasure_boards.py\nmeasure_previews.py\nmeasure_sheets.py\noverflow_check.py\nrender.py\nrender_dc.py\nresize_board.py\nsetup_card_icons.json\nsetup_card_lib.py\nspec_lines.py\nturn_yes.json\nupdate_matrix.py\nupdate_recovery.py\nupdate_screens.py\nupdate_specs.py\nwalkthrough.json\ndict_keys(['v', 'attachments', 'boards', 'createdOnFiles', 'designSystems', 'launch', 'noteOrder', 'notes', 'order', 'pages', 'title'])\n[('main-page', 'Main Page'), ('compositions', 'Compositions'), ('setup-card', 'Current Setup Card'), ('plates-project', 'Plates & Project Pane'), ('printer-material', 'Printer & Material Settings'), ('agent-ui', 'Agent UI · States & Components'), ('onboarding', 'On boarding experience'), ('calibration', 'Calibration · Printer & Filament'), ('check-print', 'Check print · Plan verification'), ('agent-prefs', 'Agent setup & Preferences'), ('print-history', 'Print history'), ('credits-plans', 'Credits & plans')]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b91e1de3-60ad-4902-b1e1-67021fcf9b3f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
