{"parentUuid":"4194bec2-36ae-458d-b464-ad553ae7c969","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfT1jZrADUT9fnJaeTHw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Only partly. The old onboarding wizard (`onboarding-00` to `20`, with 10a, 11a and 19a) is flagged: it sits at the bottom of the page under the title \"Superseded: the onboarding wizard\" and a purple note saying first-run-01 to 11 replace it as of 2026-11-02.\n\nTwo older items in the area you're looking at are not flagged:\n\n- **`credits-01b-welcome`**, the old welcome screen with the first-month offer. The new welcome replaces it, but only the first-run note beside board 01 says so. The board has no note of its own and hasn't moved.\n- **The title above `onboarding-v1-01` to `03`**, which still reads \"(shown after 00, replaces 01–09)\". That points at wizard boards, but the v1 boards are still current: in the new flow they show over Home when JusPrin v1 is found.\n\nThe other boards there are still current, as far as I can tell:\n- `credits-01c` and `01d` are the welcome-back window after a v1 import.\n- `credits-06a` and `06b` are what happens when the first month ends.\n- `credits-01a` (Preferences over Home) still fits as the \"Set up the agent\" route from Home. One small wording difference: its offer line says \"Your own API key stays free.\" where the new welcome says \"Then paid, or your own key.\"\n\nShould I flag 1b the same way as the wizard and reword the v1 title? It's one more publish to the canvas."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1107,"cache_read_input_tokens":323242,"output_tokens":853,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":382},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1107,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":853,"cache_read_input_tokens":323242,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1107,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1107},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgfT1j4bcGPoJb6Zn3AnM","requestRef":"3db87a75-4279-403b-af39-c5043917e163","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bf301928-c7f2-4c65-8da3-a600a47a0eb8","timestamp":"2026-11-03T05:33:43.693Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror/work-first-run/project","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
