.md) — A+C+D; Check plan link, \"changed…\n- [Hidden pane](hidden-browser-pane-no-raf.md) — 0 rAF frames; use Playwright.\n- Credits and pricing: [Chat cost](per-chat-cost-estimate.md) — Opus 5.5 measured $0.30-0.56 per…; [Pricing corrections](pricing-brainstorm-corrections.md) — low usage = low stickiness; Obico…; [Usage against quota](usage-against-quota-common-shape.md) — real screens of several products…; [Get more credits](one-action-to-get-more-credits.md) — one action to a page that…; [v1 subscribers](v1-subscribers-grandfathered.md) — Hobby at their original price…; [\"1 credit\"](credit-price-needs-its-unit.md) — confusing alone; \"1 credit a…; [One kind of credit](credits-one-kind-no-ceiling.md) — 2026-11-02 evening: no…; [Credits only](balances-in-credits-only.md) — no message counts on a balance…; [Credits boards](credits-boards-live-on-flow-pages.md) — on their flows' canvas pages…\n- [Chat capture](jusprin-chat-capture-design.md) — every chat kept raw, no opt-out…\n- [Live suite](live-suite-is-part-of-done.md) — model-text changes need it before…\n- [No forcing field](no-required-field-to-force-a-question.md) — when to ask belongs in the prompt.\n- [Rebuild a request](rebuild-wire-request-from-saved-chat.md) — from current-state.json + source.\n- [Reproduce for real](reproduce-on-real-app-not-fakes.md) — a failing fake test is no repro.\n- [Chat keeps its model](chat-keeps-its-model.md) — for now no mid-chat switch; docs…\n- [Show the board](show-the-board-when-asking-kenneth.md) — no bare \"6a\": say what the person…\n- [Board PNGs](render-canvas-boards-with-render-dc.md) — render_dc.py draws dc-imports…\n- [Sign-up reason](sign-up-reason-must-be-prominent.md) — the offer is the headline; the…\n- [Print report placement](print-report-lives-on-history-entry.md) — on the history entry, not in…\n- [AppConfig set trap](appconfig-set-const-char-goes-to-bool.md) — a const char* goes to the bool…\n- [Standard titles](standard-title-answers-instead.md) — 4 of