{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","hash":"81d4bd7b57af7c07385fe5608269caf770a74442791c1252e3bb6ce0aa86e31b","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016ww7EsvogLRu2r8MVMLYfL","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan updated: step 2 of 6 is in progress."}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013SbpvF6N7aQ2AtyCxDDjUZ","type":"tool_result","content":"?? .playwright-mcp/\n     487 src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/HomeUI/src/components/Onboarding.tsx\n      63 src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Home/OnboardingModel.hpp\n     550 total\nOnboardingModel.cpp\nOnboardingModel.hpp","is_error":false},{"type":"text","text":"The user sent a new message while you were working:\nAlso, if the user choose default printer, they will land on the page that says assumed with a warning sign. It's fucking confusing.\n\nThis is how Claude Code surfaces messages the user sends mid-turn — within the running turn, often alongside the next tool result, rather than as a separate conversation turn. Address the message above as you continue this turn."},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}}]}}
