nch skipping Printers. The clip is the placeholder animatic at `resources/jusprin/welcome/welcome-clip.mp4`; CC BY credits sit in a \"Photo credits\" disclosure under the clip, not the About box. Never press \"Sign in for 500 credits\" on Kenneth's Mac during a check: the browser is signed in and it completes by itself.\n\n**2026-11-03 afternoon:** the sign-in door is now Google + email (code or password), with an import result screen and the v1 line; see [[old-onboarding-boards-review]] for commits, tests and gaps. App branch `claude/first-run-flow-f7be35` (3df2ed9c24), gateway branch `claude/email-sign-in` in tsd-enterprise (81efc6fd43). Not pushed.\ncalibration-generators-replace-project.md\nfirst-run-flow-sequence.md\nfirst-run-flow-boards.md\nfirst-run-value-prop-decisions.md\npricing-brainstorm-corrections.md\nprinter-live-harness-lessons.md\nprompt-principles-vs-state-channels.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cfc927fd-faef-487b-93ca-3e9cec30ab7c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
