ing on the browser after Continue with Google (04) and signed in (05); Preferences \\u203a Agent modal over the welcome for the key door (06).\\n\\nRow 2, step 1 by email, built 2026-11-03 (Kenneth: \\u201cYes, build it\\u201d), not released: Continue with email sends nothing and asks how to sign in, an emailed code or the password (12); a wrong password (13); the code being typed, which signs in on the sixth digit (14); a wrong code (15); a code that expired or was tried five times (16). A new address gets its account when the code is asked for.\\n\\nRow 3, step 2: OrcaSlicer found (07), or the add-printer form with Skip, use a default (08). JusPrin v1 found skips the step for the welcome-back window, onboarding-v1-01 to 03.\\n\\nRow 4, step 3: Home after sign-in with an OrcaSlicer import (09), and after Just slice with the assumed default (10).\\n\\nHome has no agent column today; 09 and 10 put an Agent group above Printers in its right column. The printers, filament counts and the default printer are examples.\"}\n['n16', 'n15', 'n34', 'comp-title', 'dsagent1']\n['Main.dc.html', 'comp-pinned-setup-card.dc.html', 'comp-pinned-setup-card-stress.dc.html']","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b729e018-a323-4a3d-b5bb-7a79b4e6c398","timestamp":"2026-11-05T22:26:05.013Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"work-first-run-door/:\nproject\nruntime\n\nwork-first-run-door/runtime:\nblobs.json\nclip-benchy-model.png\nclip-benchy-sliced.png\nclip-photo-clean.jpg\nclip-photo-stringing.jpg\ndc-runtime.js\ngoogle-g.svg\njusprin-lockup-dark.svg\njusprin-lockup-light.svg\nviewport-a1mini.jpg\nviewport-p1s.jpg\nvp-a1-benchy-2x.jpg\nvp-a1-empty-2x.jpg\nvp-a1-empty-clean-2x.jpg\nvp-a1-hook-2x.jpg\nvp-a1-hook-side-2x.jpg\nvp-a1-hook-side.jpg\nvp-a1-hook.jpg\nvp-noprinter-benchy-2x.jpg\nvp-noprinter-benchy.jpg\nvp-noprinter-hook-2x.jpg\nvp-noprinter-hook.jpg\n(eval):1: no matches found: work-first-run-door/render*\n__pycache__\nadd_turn_line_boards.py\nancestry.py\nbuild_all_settings.py\nbuild_calibration_page.py\nbuild_check_print_page.py\nbuild_composer_board.py\nbuild_composer_card.py\nbuild_credits_page.py\nbuild_filament_step.py\nbuild_file_printer_page.py\nbuild_first_run_page.py\nbuild_key_states.py\nbuild_key_states.py.bak-2026-10-21\nbuild_no_agent_boards.py\nbuild_search_board.py\nbuild_setup_card_rework.py\nbuild_sticky_options.py\nbuild_turn_action_details.py\nbuild_turn_activity_board.py\nchat_text_step_up.py\nchat_text_step_up_specs.py\ncomposer_html.py\ndock_setup.py\nfilament_step_heights.json\nfit_content.py\ngrow_frames.py\nhtmlfrag.py\nmeasure_boards.py\nmeasure_previews.py\nmeasure_sheets.py\noverflow_check.py\nrender.py\nrender_dc.py\nresize_board.py\nsetup_card_icons.json\nsetup_card_lib.py\nspec_lines.py\nturn_yes.json\nupdate_matrix.py\n{\"x\": -1920, \"y\": 6160, \"w\": 420, \"page\": \"onboarding\", \"fill\": \"purple\", \"text\": \"Decided by Kenneth, 2026-11-02 (\\u201cDraw them\\u201d). A controller owns the step; the doors are detours that return into the sequence.\\n\\nRow 1, step 1: the sign-in door waiting on the browser after Continue with Google (04) and signed in (05); Preferences \\u203a Agent modal over the welcome for the key door (06).\\n\\nRow 2, step 1 by email, built 2026-11-03 (Kenneth: \\u201cYes, build it\\u201d), not released: Continue with email sends nothing and asks how to sign in, an emailed code or the password (12); a wrong password (13); the code being typed, which signs in on the sixth digit (14); a wrong code (15); a code that expired or was tried five times (16). A new address gets its account when the code is asked for.\\n\\nRow 3, step 2: OrcaSlicer found (07), or the add-printer form with Skip, use a default (08). JusPrin v1 found skips the step for the welcome-back window, onboarding-v1-01 to 03.\\n\\nRow 4, step 3: Home after sign-in with an OrcaSlicer import (09), and after Just slice with the assumed default (10).\\n\\nHome has no agent column today; 09 and 10 put an Agent group above Printers in its right column. The printers, filament counts and the default printer are examples.\"}\n['n16', 'n15', 'n34', 'comp-title', 'dsagent1']\n['Main.dc.html', 'comp-pinned-setup-card.dc.html', 'comp-pinned-setup-card-stress.dc.html']","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9784e4ea-f068-404c-b826-db26b43c258e","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
