{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","hash":"256bacfd17e3951dda1aae4c481392e73c53c34458e64d69438596d1ba5513e8","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Published the corrected printer step (canvas version 105). Now updating the spec, the screenshots and my notes to match."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LPuCcPGmK3owHdVKkdMEeb","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md","old_string":"7. **Back** (link) last, as on board 07. Back returns to the welcome, as now.\n\nRemoved from this step: the \"Step 1 of 3\" marker, Cancel, the plate and filament steps, and \"Import from an OrcaSlicer folder…\".","new_string":"7. **The OrcaSlicer folder choice**, one quiet line: \"OrcaSlicer printers in another folder?\" (label, secondary) and the link \"Choose the folder…\". It does what \"Import from an OrcaSlicer folder…\" does today (a47a30ea7f). Kenneth approved this manual folder choice on 2026-11-03, so it stays; only its wording and place change.\n8. **Back** (link) last, as on board 07. Back returns to the welcome, as now.\n\nRemoved from this step: the \"Step 1 of 3\" marker, Cancel, and the plate and filament steps."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014VVXiea2AHYiYAPo1AC4iA","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin; sed -i '' 's/version 104)/version 105)/; s/Gone or hidden//' /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md; grep -n \"and \\\"Import from an OrcaSlicer folder…\\\"\\|no \\\"Import from\" /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md; D=/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/design-captures/first-run-2026-11/v104; cp figma-mirror/work-first-run-v2/render/first-run-08-add-printer.png figma-mirror/work-first-run-v2/render/first-run-11-flow.png figma-mirror/work-first-run-v2/render-dark/first-run-08-add-printer-dark.png $D/; echo \"Same day, version 105 (1793918006-db61): 08 gets back the OrcaSlicer folder choice Kenneth approved 2026-11-03 (\\\"OrcaSlicer printers in another folder? Choose the folder…\\\"); the printer note says so.\" >> figma-mirror/README.md; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='memory/first-run-flow-sequence.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"Continue + Skip for now with its consequence, Back; no dialog, counter, Cancel, plate/filament steps)\",\"Continue + Skip for now with its consequence, the OrcaSlicer folder choice Kenneth approved 2026-11-03 as one quiet line (v105; I first removed it by mistake), Back; no dialog, counter, Cancel, plate/filament steps)\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -c \"v105\" memory/first-run-flow-sequence.md","description":"Update spec version, screenshots, publish log and memory for the folder-choice fix"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
