{"parentUuid":"22b4bfab-8b44-470f-89b7-0264739ea065","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkaRuaruvV2kmBBiKU4R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The coding session replied, and it caught a mistake of mine. I've fixed it and published the fix (canvas version 105).\n\n**What it said.** Its instructions told it to put the existing add-printer dialog on that step, so it embedded the dialog as it is. That's where \"Step 1 of 3\", Cancel and Next come from. On its own it added two things:\n- **The \"Import from an OrcaSlicer folder…\" link.** That came from a choice you approved on 2026-11-03: a manual folder choice when no OrcaSlicer folder is found. My notes from that day confirm it.\n- **The \"assumed\" generic printer.** It got there because none of my boards showed what skipping should leave behind.\n\nSo the agent wasn't confused. It was filling gaps in my boards.\n\n**My mistake.** My first redraw removed the folder link, which reversed your decision. It's back on the printer step as one quiet line under the skip hint: \"OrcaSlicer printers in another folder? Choose the folder…\". It does the same thing as the link the app has today. The build spec and the coding session both have the change.\n\n**Still open.** You didn't see the JusPrin logo on that screen, but the code does draw it on every printer screen. Nobody has checked why it didn't show; that needs a look in the real app.\n\nThe question about the printer chip in a project, from my last message, is still waiting for your answer."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_read_input_tokens":274243,"output_tokens":441,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":441,"cache_read_input_tokens":274243,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgkaRuGmQRbpq8LzahpRT","requestRef":"c43bba85-5e6c-4297-a42d-a443337fbbd7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"d721a2f6-929f-4552-a07c-3d65b0f3a5a7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T22:33:53.463Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
