s content changed since then: read it again before relying on what you remember of it.)\n<artifact-content-authored-by-others/>\n</artifact-view-context>\n\n<!-- reply 1 -->\n> whether the printer chip inside a project should also drop its “assumed” warning and just say “Generic printer · 0.4 mm”.\n\nyes\n\n\nHow can I see your new design?"}]},"uuid":"4bf0a251-c029-4217-a5cd-2051c97439bd","timestamp":"2026-11-05T22:39:02.483Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":6,"turnIndex":17},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
