{"parentUuid":"bc062ed4-81ac-44b6-8774-c15465c14cf0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkaqxmWubojkTy7RC5sN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've opened the canvas for you. You're already on the right page, \"On boarding experience\", and the new screens are in view:\n\n- **\"Step 2 · Your printer\" row:** the leftmost board, \"08 · Your printer: which printer do you have?\", is the redrawn printer step. Next to it are the OrcaSlicer import screen (07) and \"Imported from OrcaSlicer\" (17).\n- **\"Step 3 · Home\" row, further down:** board 10, on the right, is Home after skipping, with the \"No printer yet\" card. Board 09, on the left, is Home after signing in and picking a printer.\n- **Top of the page:** the map of the whole first launch. It shows the usual path as four small screens, and under each step the other ways through it. Start there if you want to see the flow from the beginning.\n\nIf you'd rather not scroll, the same screens are saved as pictures in [design-captures/first-run-2026-11/v104/](design-captures/first-run-2026-11/v104/).\n\nI've marked the printer chip change as agreed in the spec and told the coding session it can build that part. The redrawn printer step and the \"No printer yet\" Home card still wait for your go."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1779,"cache_read_input_tokens":277825,"output_tokens":525,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":148},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1779,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":525,"cache_read_input_tokens":277825,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1779,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1779},"type":"messa