{"parentUuid":"c1e546b8-ade5-4bba-922a-dd153929da3a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkcfhKY7YAesfqMYxzrc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018erNmk5r33kyW4mzXPzckc","name":"ArtifactComments","input":{"action":"reply","url":"https://claude.ai/code/artifact/6c3cbfd4-9305-484c-9fea-4f7fa7cfeeb3","thread_id":"7209d3ad-37b0-4069-b711-15416ebf2872","text":"Yes. When OrcaSlicer printers are found, 07 (\"Bring your printers from OrcaSlicer?\") is the first printer screen, and 08 only shows after Start fresh. Leaving the line off 07 was an oversight. Done on version 107: 07 now opens with the same \"Signed in as … · 500 credits\" line above its headline. The rule is that whichever printer screen comes first carries over what the welcome finished. The import result screen (17) comes after 07, so it doesn't repeat the line. The build spec and the coding session have the change."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7008,"cache_read_input_tokens":331028,"output_tokens":703,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":176},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7008,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":703,"cache_read_input_tokens":331028,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7008,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7008},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_018erNmk5r33kyW4mzXPzckc":{"action":"reply","url":"https://claude.ai/code/artifact/6c3cbfd4-9305-484c-9fea-4f7fa7cfeeb3","thread_id":"7209d3ad-37b0-4069-b711-15416ebf2872","text":"Yes. When OrcaSlicer printers are found, 07 (\"Bring your printers from OrcaSlicer?\") is the first printer screen, and 08 only shows after Start fresh. Leaving the line off 07 was an oversight. Done on version 107: 07 now opens with the same \"Signed in as … · 500 credits\" line above its headline. The rule is that whichever printer screen comes first carries over what the welcome finished. The import result screen (17) comes after 07, so it doesn't repeat the line. The build spec and the coding session have the change."}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgkcfh4urppRL4NFjU3eh","requestRef":"e63a1392-47f8-4957-80e9-a360f0ae5c8d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_session_mgmt","attributionMcpTool":"send_message","type":"assistant","uuid":"78c2ecd6-e533-4168-9953-68c460d783c5","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:03:14.798Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/figma-mirror","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
