{"parentUuid":"d9139c14-48c5-4c4d-9995-cad56eb6fd27","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkd3usDE5ESiZFEjCRyh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HHD6zZoMDVxCVSJ7WpANeW","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"- `orca_printers` is true when either list is non-empty.\n- Add a test with an OrcaSlicer folder that has only ticked printers.\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"- `orca_printers` is true when either list is non-empty.\n- Add a test with an OrcaSlicer folder that has only ticked printers.\n\nDetails the design session settled on 2026-11-05 (canvas version 108), which follow from the points above:\n- Also count the printer OrcaSlicer has selected, `\"presets\": {\"machine\": ...}` in OrcaSlicer.conf, when it is a system printer JusPrin has. On Kenneth's Mac that is \"Bambu Lab P1S 0.4 nozzle\", which is not in `\"models\"`.\n- A saved preset covers a ticked printer when its `inherits` names that printer's system preset. In that case list only the saved preset.\n- After the import, select OrcaSlicer's selected printer if it came over. Otherwise select the first imported printer.\n- Board 17 gets one line per ticked printer, such as \"Bambu Lab A1 mini 0.4 nozzle\" with a check, the same as a saved one. A ticked printer that fails to install shows as not imported, and Retry covers it.\n- Back on 08 returns to the screen before it. That is 07 when the person came from 07's Start fresh, so clear `fresh_start`. Otherwise it is the welcome, as now.\n- With `--datadir X/JusPrin`, detection only looks at `X/OrcaSlicer`. A test copy there needs `\"models\"` and `\"presets\"` in its OrcaSlicer.conf, not only `app.preset_folder`.\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\ns=s.replace(\"ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, version 107)\",\"ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, version 108)\")\ns=s.replace(\"8. 