` names that printer's system preset. In that case list only the saved preset.\n- After the import, select OrcaSlicer's selected printer if it came over. Otherwise select the first imported printer.\n- Board 17 gets one line per ticked printer, such as \"Bambu Lab A1 mini 0.4 nozzle\" with a check, the same as a saved one. A ticked printer that fails to install shows as not imported, and Retry covers it.\n- Back on 08 returns to the screen before it. That is 07 when the person came from 07's Start fresh, so clear `fresh_start`. Otherwise it is the welcome, as now.\n- With `--datadir X/JusPrin`, detection only looks at `X/OrcaSlicer`. A test copy there needs `\"models\"` and `\"presets\"` in its OrcaSlicer.conf, not only `app.preset_folder`.\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\ns=s.replace(\"ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, version 107)\",\"ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, version 108)\")\ns=s.replace(\"8. **Back** (link) last, as on board 07. Back returns to the welcome, as now.\",\"8. **Back** (link) last, as on board 07. Back returns to the screen before: 07 after its Start fresh, otherwise the welcome.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"version 108\\|Back returns\" first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgkd3ud5zPF7FGWX3pDwG","requestRef":"1f993ee2-4712-4b94-9e4b-b42a97b8ce4d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_session_mgmt","attributionMcpTool":"list_sessions","type":"assistant","uuid":"7e76b16e-0c3f-475f-ab1d-de16dc789793","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:08:25.695Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
{"parentUuid":"7e76b16e-0c3f-475f-ab1d-de16dc789793","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"57b8a240-2346-4052-9b4a-2e21da0c2a34","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HHD6zZoMDVxCVSJ7WpANeW","type":"tool_result","content":"7:The screens are on the \"JusPrin v2\" canvas (https://claude.ai/artifact/ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, version 108), page \"On boarding experience\". The page now starts with a map board, `first-run-11-flow`, showing the usual path and every other way through each step. PNGs: `design-captures/first-run-2026-11/v104/`.\n30:8. **Back** (link) last, as on board 07. Back returns to the screen before: 07 after its Start fresh, otherwise the welcome.\n51:Details the design session settled on 2026-11-05 (canvas version 108), which follow from the points above:","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"468343f5-c8ba-4d3b-904a-689d80cb52ed","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:08:25.990Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"7:The screens are on the \"JusPrin v2\" canvas (https://claude.ai/artifact/ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, version 108), page \"On boarding experience\". The page now starts with a map board, `first-run-11-flow`, showing the usual path and every other way through each step. PNGs: `design-captures/first-run-2026-11/v104/`.\n30:8. **Back** (link) last, as on board 07. Back returns to the screen before: 07 after its Start fresh, otherwise the welcome.\n51:Details the design session settled on 2026-11-05 (canvas version 108), which follow from the points above:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":7,"newStart":4,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," **Status: agreed. Kenneth said yes to the printer chip on 2026-11-05, then \"Go with your recommendations\" for the rest: the printer step (08), the \"No printer yet\" card (10), \"Ask the agent\", and reading the printers ticked in OrcaSlicer. Build it.**"," ","-The screens are on the \"JusPrin v2\" canvas (https://claude.ai/artifact/ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, version 107), page \"On boarding experience\". The page now starts with a map board, `first-run-11-flow`, showing the usual path and every other way through each step. PNGs: `design-captures/first-run-2026-11/v104/`.","+The screens are on the \"JusPrin v2\" canvas (https://claude.ai/artifact/ENCtdaz7gjynfbcy4JYbWJ, version 108), page \"On boarding experience\". The page now starts with a map board, `first-run-11-flow`, showing the usual path and every other way through each step. PNGs: `design-captures/first-run-2026-11/v104/`."," "," ## Why the built screens confuse"," "]},{"oldStart":27,"oldLines":7,"newStart":27,"newLines":7,"lines":[" 5. **Nozzle**: a segmented choice of the chosen model's nozzles, starting on `startingNozzle()` (0.4 where offered). Under it: \"Most printers ship with 0.4 mm.\""," 6. **Continue** (primary) and **Skip for now** (link) on one row. Under them, tertiary label: \"Skip, and JusPrin slices for a generic 0.4 mm printer until you add yours.\""," 7. **The OrcaSlicer folder choice**, one quiet line: \"OrcaSlicer printers in another folder?\" (label, secondary) and the link \"Choose the folder…\". It does what \"Import from an OrcaSlicer folder…\" does today (a47a30ea7f). Kenneth approved this manual folder choice on 2026-11-03, so it stays; only its wording and place change.","-8. **Back** (link) last, as on board 07. Back returns to the welcome, as now.","+8. **Back** (link) last, as on board 07. Back returns to the screen before: 07 after its Start fresh, otherwise the welcome."," "," Removed from this step: the \"Step 1 of 3\" marker, Cancel, and the plate and filament steps."," "]},{"oldStart":48,"oldLines":6,"newStart":48,"newLines":14,"lines":[" - `orca_printers` is true when either list is non-empty."," - Add a test with an OrcaSlicer folder that has only ticked printers."," ","+Details the design session settled on 2026-11-05 (canvas version 108), which follow from the points above:","+- Also count the printer OrcaSlicer has selected, `\"presets\": {\"machine\": ...}` in OrcaSlicer.conf, when it is a system printer JusPrin has. On Kenneth's Mac that is \"Bambu Lab P1S 0.4 nozzle\", which is not in `\"models\"`.","+- A saved preset covers a ticked printer when its `inherits` names that printer's system preset. In that case list only the saved preset.","+- After the import, select OrcaSlicer's selected printer if it came over. Otherwise select the first imported printer.","+- Board 17 gets one line per ticked printer, such as \"Bambu Lab A1 mini 0.4 nozzle\" with a check, the same as a saved one. A ticked printer that fails to install shows as not imported, and Retry covers it.","+- Back on 08 returns to the screen before it. That is 07 when the person came from 07's Start fresh, so clear `fresh_start`. Otherwise it is the welcome, as now.","+- With `--datadir X/JusPrin`, detection only looks at `X/OrcaSlicer`. A test copy there needs `\"models\"` and `\"presets\"` in its OrcaSlicer.conf, not only `app.preset_folder`.","+"," ## Board 17: \"Imported from OrcaSlicer\""," "," Already built (`ImportResult` in `HomeUI/src/components/Onboarding.tsx`); the board now draws it so the canvas matches the app. No change asked."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/first-run-printer-step-spec-2026-11-05.md"]}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7e76b16e-0c3f-475f-ab1d-de16dc789793","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"473348c5-5f94-4e4d-9ad9-c7e9dd10b438","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glimmering-doodling-lovelace"}
